Subject: [PATCH] Retry Qt Widgets RHI recovery until presentation succeeds

Retain recovery state when QRhi or its first swap chain cannot be recreated.
Coalesce rebuilding outside rendering with capped backoff per backing store,
release resources for hidden windows, and recreate them on the next expose.
Successful presentation resets the backoff. Cancel stale widget requests and
delete failed swap chains before retrying.

